### 1. create a user (database is empty after the migration)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "name": "Luka Ong",
  "password": "secret"
}

### 2. log in
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### 3. create a blog as the logged-in user
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "author": "Luka the greatest sql developer",
  "url": "https://luka.sql.com/articles/bestsql.html",
  "title": "SQL is the best"
}

### 4. list blogs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs

### 5. like the blog
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "likes": 15
}

